{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scav is about scavenging \u2014 survive the raid, or lose everything trying.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scav is a low poly looter shooter with survival elements, set in a world where every infected zone is scheduled for nuclear extermination. When the outbreak hits, you're dropped in to scavenge what\u2019s left \u2014 and get out before the blast.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start your journey in the safezone, a private haven where you can store your gear, stash your cash in the bank, buy weapons, tools, and properties, or customize your character's appearance. Stock up at vendor shops, prepare your loadout, and ready up for the next raid.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Load into an abandoned, overgrown city \u2014 a quarantine zone surrounded by sand and the dead. You've got one goal: loot everything you can before the nuclear sanitation protocol wipes the place off the map. With a ticking clock and the undead roaming the zone, every raid is a deadly gamble.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search buildings, underground bunkers, and radiation zones for valuable gear and rare items. Secure what you can, extract alive, and return home \u2014 or die and lose it all.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest in properties. Plan your builds around upcoming updates like crafting, farming, and manufacturing.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931750/extras/b11511381a316c21a1488de7d249e42f.avif?t=1756371967\" width=800 height=2000 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931750?t=1756371967","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931750/efcf47fc105eb7f69106ac48000184bac99bbdd0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756371967","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931750/30b20d46156b76b4bd5859d15c6212baba5cb85e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756371967","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931750/30b20d46156b76b4bd5859d15c6212baba5cb85e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756371967","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Scav is a third- and first-person extract-style shooter with zombies. The game includes violence in the form of combat against zombies using firearms. Players may encounter depictions of blood, gore, and injury consistent with a post-apocalyptic survival scenario.\r\n\r\nThe game also contains drug-related mechanics planned for future updates, such as farming and processing of illegal substances, along with associated story and gameplay elements. Alcohol use may be referenced in the context of survival gameplay.\r\n\r\nThe content is intended for a mature audience due to violence and drug-related themes."},"demos":[{"appid":3946410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scav is about scavenging \u2014 survive the raid, or lose everything trying.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scav is a low poly looter shooter with survival elements, set in a world where every infected zone is scheduled for nuclear extermination. When the outbreak hits, you're dropped in to scavenge what\u2019s left \u2014 and get out before the blast.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start your journey in the safezone, a private haven where you can store your gear, stash your cash in the bank, buy weapons, tools, and properties, or customize your character's appearance. Stock up at vendor shops, prepare your loadout, and ready up for the next raid.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Load into an abandoned, overgrown city \u2014 a quarantine zone surrounded by sand and the dead. You've got one goal: loot everything you can before the nuclear sanitation protocol wipes the place off the map. With a ticking clock and the undead roaming the zone, every raid is a deadly gamble.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search buildings, underground bunkers, and radiation zones for valuable gear and rare items. Secure what you can, extract alive, and return home \u2014 or die and lose it all.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest in properties. Plan your builds around upcoming updates like crafting, farming, and manufacturing.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931750/extras/b11511381a316c21a1488de7d249e42f.avif?t=1756371967\" width=800 height=2000 /></span></p>","developers":["Cannabusy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931750/d3131bd85fd59904bde98532a8e1d52e95cfa108/header.jpg?t=1756371967","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommende